<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103934" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῐθηνός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θῆσθαι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>nursing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					1398
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόνων τιθηνοὺς ἀποδιδοῦσά σοι
				τροφάς</span> repaying thee nurture for thy <i>nursing</i>
			labours, i.e. rewarding thee for thy trouble in nursing me, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IA</u>
				1230
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιθηνός, ὁ</span>, <i>one who nurses</i> or brings up,
				<i>foster-father</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Nu.</u>
				11.12
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				54.1
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. τοῦ υἱοῦ τοῦ βασιλέως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Sammelb.</u>
					1568.2
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>: also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιθηνός, ἡ,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιθήνη</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				44.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.322c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>nursling</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παῖδα τιθηνόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14.1437
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
